tps://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620940_1835310707853894_4346393808474327715_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SAVsoqCJIYoQ7kNvwFQZhQt&_nc_oc=AdqTwo-CTkkuNdJ7RTYirwibBK8-1fVEMeYjmYnEqleTXl5kT61KXwm06lKIWYza0C4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCRuWlepp2JMHPI40tgB076dLEWnl1vr7kIsI5N9aMs2Q&oe=6A5CB04A"}, {"file_name": "260701_PDP_002.png", "id": "4083541681937026", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499625099_4083541685270359_2246704207310991901_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cui0_rZGZeYQ7kNvwGX6ZDv&_nc_oc=AdrhCnG16Lv8hQdcSzrQmRsRd2_XExeAsHwCVaZOFkOyE73dHipJIXbSzDD3szxjS7c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBlpxEE0CHQXqZ5xa5lb3n2UcIkMCaH6mH6WPpQeTqplQ&oe=6A5CC6F7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image_PNG_2560_1440 copy_inc.quest.png", "id": "791295697339460", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619751_791295700672793_7369802125281385492_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BG50M27NptIQ7kNvwHF0BEO&_nc_oc=AdqR9YK2soNOIpRggUxAP3RzS5gGYZw1ovxWr18HQbV6Xjj14-Cs0aPxGcAAOWmA1W8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDWPF-YIJpRArKchcpOEwspCaZ1ES5b2GdaSN9ly8q7cA&oe=6A5CCFA9"}, "display_name": "O2 the Forest", "keywords": ["horror", "survival", "scary", "multiplayer", "free"], "long_description": "The forest is contaminated. The cats survived. You probably won't.\nOne campfire. Your safe zone \u2014 breathe, regroup, stay alive. Let it die \u2014 it comes hunting.\nDay \u2014 scavenge, craft, fortify. Night \u2014 they come. Fast. Vicious. Won't stop.\nSuvive 99 nights for the reward.\nNight is coming.\n\n**Weekly updates bring new threats, new regions, and new classes.**\n\n# How to survive this forest:\n\ud83e\ude93 **Choose Your Class & Play Your Role**\n\nPick from classes with their own distinct roles and abilities. The team you build will define how \u2014 and whether \u2014 you survive the night.\n{1567301741670289}\n\n**\ud83c\udf32 Co-op Survival & The Terror of Night**\n\nTake down the infected wandering the woods with your team and claim what they leave behind. Before the dark closes in, the campfire must hold \u2014 or none of you see the next dawn.\n\n{1363490079159310}\n\n\n**\ud83d\udd26 Exploration & Resource Gathering**\n\nPush deeper into the deep woods, the ruins, and the unknown. Every step forward uncovers the resources that will make you stronger.\n\n{1544565307273551}\n\n**\ud83c\udf56 Growth & Camp Expansion**\n\nCook food from what you've gathered and grow your campfire from a flicker into a stronghold. A warm meal and a bigger flame are what carry your team through the next night.\n\n{1252533096864827}\n\n**\ud83c\udfe0 Home Building & Protecting Your Team**\n\nBuild and decorate your own home \u2014 make it a place your teammates can truly rest. The wall you raise today may be the last shield standing when the deepest night comes.\n\n{1380188540810484}\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Join our official Discord to be the first to hear about updates and participate in exclusive events where you can earn Gems!\nhttps://o2theforest.com/discord\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Experience the addictive 99-Nights gameplay loop with fast-paced Gorilla-Tag locomotion in O2 The Forest, a FREE co-op VR survival horror game for Meta Quest. Explore, gather resources, and build your own base by day. When darkness falls, defend it against terrifying creatures with your friends and see how many nights you can survive."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://o2theforest.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://o2theforest.com/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Lapsix", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://o2theforest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "27